    "source": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/instrument/1/fixed_income/structured_credit.schema.json#/$defs/CccBucketRule/properties/carry_at_market_value",
    "description": "`true` carries the excess at the assets' `market_price_pct` (assets\nwithout a price stay at par); `false` excludes the excess entirely."
